  "topic": {
    "id": "diode-loop",
    "order": 2,
    "title": {
      "zh": "二极管与通路",
      "en": "Diodes and Current Paths"
    }
  },
  "stage": "explain",
  "title": {
    "zh": "开关合上了，灯怎么还没亮？",
    "en": "Why Is the Lamp Still Dark?"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "一圈导线里串着普通二极管、电阻和红色 LED。找出让红灯亮起的两个条件。",
    "en": "One loop holds a diode, a resistor and a red LED. Find the two conditions that let the red lamp light."
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "闭合回路与二极管的方向",
    "en": "A complete loop and diode polarity"
  },
  "hints": [],
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "从电源走一圈",
        "en": "Trace a complete loop"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "用手指从电源正极沿电路走到负极。开关断开时路上有个缺口。合上开关，路就接通了。",
        "en": "Trace the path from the positive supply terminal around to the negative terminal. An open switch leaves a gap. Closing it joins the two sides."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "看二极管上的色环",
        "en": "Find the band on the diode"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "普通二极管有阳极 A 和阴极 K，图中带色环的一端是 K。在这块低压实验板上，正向放置时，常规电流能从 A 流向 K。翻转它，电流就小到点不亮灯。",
        "en": "A diode has an anode A and a cathode K. The band marks K on this part. In this low-voltage circuit, conventional current can flow from A to K when it faces forward. Reversing it leaves too little current to light the lamp."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "哪一个元件会发光？",
        "en": "Which part makes light?"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "红色 LED 也是二极管，它在正向通电时会发光。普通二极管用来改变电流能否通过。红灯固定接好，串联电阻用来限制通过灯的电流。",
        "en": "The red LED is a light-emitting diode. It lights when forward current flows. Here you turn the ordinary diode to control the path. The LED stays facing forward and its series resistor limits the current."
      }
    }
  ],
  "question": {
    "prompt": {
      "zh": "开关已闭合，普通二极管反向，红灯熄灭。只翻转普通二极管会怎样？",
      "en": "The switch is closed, the ordinary diode is reversed, and the red LED is dark. What happens if you flip just the ordinary diode?"
    },
    "options": [
      {
        "zh": "红灯会亮",
        "en": "The LED lights"
      },
      {
        "zh": "开关自动断开",
        "en": "The switch opens itself"
      },
      {
        "zh": "电阻也要翻转才行",
        "en": "The resistor must be flipped too"
      }
    ],
    "correct": 0,
    "feedback": {
      "zh": "翻转后，正向二极管和闭合开关组成完整通路，电流也流过红灯。",
      "en": "After the flip, the forward diode and closed switch complete the path through the red LED."
    }
  },
